# Normalize text files to LF in the repo; Windows checkouts were flipping
# these to CRLF on every touch (prettier, eslint --fix, git checkout),
# which made `git status` flag dozens of files with no real content change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
